<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113222" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χᾰμ-ᾶζε</span></b> , Adv., (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαμαί</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to the
				ground, on the ground,</i> freq. in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ ὀχέων σὺν τεύχεσιν ἆλτο χ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					3.29
				</span></i>
			, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ πύργου βαῖνε χ.</span>
			stepped <i>to the ground,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				21.529
			</span></i>; [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεραυνὸν] ἧκε χ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					8.134
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				14.497
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				20.461
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. κάππεσεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					15.537
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόξον . . θῆκε χ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					21.136
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				22.340
			</span></i>: rare in Trag. and Com., <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				633
			</span></i> (troch.), <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				341
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				344
			</span></i> (both troch.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ πέσῃ χ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>V.</u>
					1012
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. προβαίνουσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Babr.
					115.13
				</span></i>
			; freq. in later Prose, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. θυρεοῖς κεκλιμένοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Sull.</u>
					28
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχειν χ. δύ᾽ ὀβολώ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Lex.</u>
					2
				</span></i>
			. (On the exceptional accent cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
			</span></i> Dion.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				322
			</span></i>, Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				2.951
			</span></i>.)</div>
